# American English: only the lines that differ from English. The rest is English.

settings-ring-keywords = favorites favorites launcher edge click hot corner voice speech windows open windows clipboard copy paste history forget notifications

settings-ring-help = Your favorites sit around the middle of the ring. You choose them in the ring itself. Right-click any app in the ring to add or remove it, and drag a favorite to another place to change the order.

settings-ring-favourites =
    { $n ->
        [one] { $n } favorite
       *[other] { $n } favorites
    }

settings-ring-opening-about = Move the pointer to the edge of the screen and double-click, or press the Super key, to open the ring. Your favorites sit around the middle of the ring, and your open windows sit in a ring around them. Click a window to bring it forward, or right-click it to see its buttons. Right-click any app in the ring to add or remove it.
